{"3321020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fluff'n'Roll", "steam_appid": 3321020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tilt the Entire Level!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Fluff’n’Roll</strong>, you tilt the entire world to move. Build speed, hit crazy angles, and replay levels to discover faster routes, hidden skips, and master your movement to beat the developer’s best time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level can be completed, replayed, and mastered by collecting up to 4 stars. Finish the level, improve your route, shave off seconds, and push for the ultimate challenge: beating the developer’s time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/e987338ce31b398ca9bb56b235436257.poster.avif?t=1786690880\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/e987338ce31b398ca9bb56b235436257.webm?t=1786690880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/e987338ce31b398ca9bb56b235436257.mp4?t=1786690880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Momentum</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire level REALLY rotates. The more you tilt it, the faster you’ll go. You’ll need to control your acceleration (or purposely send your fluffball flying through the course) to beat each level. Learn how every angle affects your speed, bounces, and landings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you master momentum, you’ll start setting times you once thought were impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/0ed7e4966e2c6053b261cb77bd64dcf4.poster.avif?t=1786690880\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/0ed7e4966e2c6053b261cb77bd64dcf4.webm?t=1786690880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/0ed7e4966e2c6053b261cb77bd64dcf4.mp4?t=1786690880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find a Faster Route</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different angles, squeeze through tight paths, launch yourself over hazards, and discover shortcuts that shouldn’t be possible. Finding a faster route is only half the challenge. The other half is learning how to pull it off consistently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/9862f70fb6eb57a3a5df37520e07e154.poster.avif?t=1786690880\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/9862f70fb6eb57a3a5df37520e07e154.webm?t=1786690880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/9862f70fb6eb57a3a5df37520e07e154.mp4?t=1786690880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll through <strong>80 levels across 5 colorful worlds</strong>, with new obstacles and increasingly demanding challenges that push your control, precision, and understanding of momentum further.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>Tilt and rotate the entire world to move</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔁 <strong>Replay levels to master every movement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏁 <strong>Collect up to 4 stars and beat the developer’s time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌎 <strong>Take on 80 handcrafted levels across 5 worlds</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Unlock new fluffball hats and patterns as you progress</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Best played with a controller, keyboard supported</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >I set my best personal time in each level as a “<i>secret</i>” fourth star. Can you beat my times?</h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tilt the Entire Level!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Fluff’n’Roll</strong>, you tilt the entire world to move. Build speed, hit crazy angles, and replay levels to discover faster routes, hidden skips, and master your movement to beat the developer’s best time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level can be completed, replayed, and mastered by collecting up to 4 stars. Finish the level, improve your route, shave off seconds, and push for the ultimate challenge: beating the developer’s time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/e987338ce31b398ca9bb56b235436257.poster.avif?t=1786690880\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/e987338ce31b398ca9bb56b235436257.webm?t=1786690880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/e987338ce31b398ca9bb56b235436257.mp4?t=1786690880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Momentum</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire level REALLY rotates. The more you tilt it, the faster you’ll go. You’ll need to control your acceleration (or purposely send your fluffball flying through the course) to beat each level. Learn how every angle affects your speed, bounces, and landings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you master momentum, you’ll start setting times you once thought were impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/0ed7e4966e2c6053b261cb77bd64dcf4.poster.avif?t=1786690880\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/0ed7e4966e2c6053b261cb77bd64dcf4.webm?t=1786690880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/0ed7e4966e2c6053b261cb77bd64dcf4.mp4?t=1786690880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find a Faster Route</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different angles, squeeze through tight paths, launch yourself over hazards, and discover shortcuts that shouldn’t be possible. Finding a faster route is only half the challenge. The other half is learning how to pull it off consistently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/9862f70fb6eb57a3a5df37520e07e154.poster.avif?t=1786690880\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/9862f70fb6eb57a3a5df37520e07e154.webm?t=1786690880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/9862f70fb6eb57a3a5df37520e07e154.mp4?t=1786690880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll through <strong>80 levels across 5 colorful worlds</strong>, with new obstacles and increasingly demanding challenges that push your control, precision, and understanding of momentum further.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>Tilt and rotate the entire world to move</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔁 <strong>Replay levels to master every movement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏁 <strong>Collect up to 4 stars and beat the developer’s time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌎 <strong>Take on 80 handcrafted levels across 5 worlds</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Unlock new fluffball hats and patterns as you progress</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Best played with a controller, keyboard supported</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >I set my best personal time in each level as a “<i>secret</i>” fourth star. Can you beat my times?</h2>", "short_description": "Fluff’n’Roll is a challenging momentum-based precision platformer where you control the stage to move. Don’t let the cute fluffs fool you: this is a game that rewards perseverance, practice, and mastery.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/f9c3ff9d3e16b4b9c9b8269f88683bb13699fb0e/header.jpg?t=1786690880", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/1b6159a8133df7a1c7a811f81df7bf92f4d301bf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786690880", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/1b6159a8133df7a1c7a811f81df7bf92f4d301bf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786690880", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong